WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.811
We found 1 issue in info.cern.ch. Let’s look at the evidence and what you can

00:00:06.811 --> 00:00:07.399
change.

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:13.343
Look at how small the page appears on a phone. The browser can lay it out as

00:00:13.343 --> 00:00:18.246
if it were on a desktop. Setting the viewport to the device width lets the

00:00:18.246 --> 00:00:19.836
mobile layout take over.

00:00:20.767 --> 00:00:25.866
Compare the original with the proposed change. The original check passed

00:00:25.866 --> 00:00:27.070
after the change.
